        260,
        908
      ],
      "margin_number": 132,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "When σa is added to verbs with stems ending in consonants the following changes occur (note that these changes are, for the most part, identical to those found in the future tense: see 114).",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 7,
      "bbox": [
        267,
        238,
        283,
        560
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "(a) β, π, πτ and φ combine with σ to produce ψ:",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 8,
      "bbox": [
        308,
        267,
        321,
        888
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "πέμπ-ω    ‘I send’    πέμπ + σ →    ἔ-πεμψα    ‘I sent’",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 9,
      "bbox": [
        336,
        238,
        351,
        649
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "(b) γ, κ, χ (and usually ττ) combine with σ to produce ξ:",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 10,
      "bbox": [
        376,
        267,
        392,
        888
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "δέξ-ομαι    ‘I receive’    δέξ + σ →    ἐ-δεξά-μην    ‘I received’",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 11,
      "bbox": [
        406,
        238,
        421,
        608
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "(c) δ, ζ, θ and τ are simply replaced by σ:",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
